---
import ConsiliumCaseLayout from '../../../layouts/ConsiliumCaseLayout.astro';
---
<ConsiliumCaseLayout title="Consilium Medicum Performance Max" description="How Performance Max complemented search acquisition for Consilium Medicum in 2024." eyebrow="PERFORMANCE MAX" headline="Search demand was only" accent="part of the system." intro="Alongside segmented Search campaigns, Performance Max was used to extend reach across Google inventory while keeping patient response measurable." metrics={[{value:'3,356',label:'account conversions · 2024'},{value:'€3.25',label:'account avg. cost / conversion'},{value:'€0.20',label:'account avg. CPC'},{value:'PMax',label:'part of the acquisition mix'}]}>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">THE ROLE</span><div><h2>Search captures intent.<br/>PMax expands reach.</h2><p class="statement">The two campaign types did different jobs inside one Google Ads account.</p><p>Segmented Search campaigns addressed explicit queries. Performance Max added broader Google inventory and additional routes to conversion. The point was not to replace Search, but to give the acquisition system another way to reach potential patients.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="map"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">SIMPLIFIED ACQUISITION MAP</span><h2>One clinic.<br/>Multiple Google surfaces.</h2><div class="orbit"><div class="core">CONSILIUM<br/><b>PATIENT<br/>DEMAND</b></div><div class="node n1"><small>SEARCH</small><strong>Explicit intent</strong></div><div class="node n2"><small>PERFORMANCE MAX</small><strong>Expanded reach</strong></div><div class="node n3"><small>LANDING PAGES</small><strong>Relevant destination</strong></div><div class="node n4"><small>MEASUREMENT</small><strong>Calls + leads</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="accent-section"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">OPERATING PRINCIPLE</span><h2>More reach does not mean<br/>less accountability.</h2><div class="flow"><span>GOOGLE INVENTORY</span><b>→</b><span>PATIENT TOUCHPOINT</span><b>→</b><span>CLINIC PAGE</span><b>→</b><span>CALL / LEAD</span><b>→</b><span>CONVERSION DATA</span></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">MEASUREMENT</span><div><h2>We report what<br/>was actually measured.</h2><p class="statement">The 2024 historical case reports 3,356 conversions across the Google Ads activity.</p><p>The source material does not provide a clean PMax-only annual conversion total, so we deliberately do not invent one. Performance Max is shown here as a documented component of the overall acquisition mix.</p></div></div></section>
</ConsiliumCaseLayout>
